Usage: explicitness-checker [-h|--help] [-v|--verbose] [--strict] [--props] [--exclude=dir] [--include-pattern=pattern] [--exclude-pattern=pattern] [--min-explicitness=percent] /path/to/project

Options:
  -h, --help                          Show this help message and exit.
  -v, --verbose                       Enable verbose output showing detailed analysis progress.
      --strict                        Enable strict mode to detect additional implicit I/O patterns.
      --props                         Also report instance property access ($this->property).
      --exclude=<dir>                 Exclude specific directories from analysis (default: vendor). Can be specified multiple times.
      --include-pattern=<pattern>     Only analyze files matching regex pattern. Can be specified multiple times.
      --exclude-pattern=<pattern>     Exclude files matching regex pattern. Can be specified multiple times.
      --min-explicitness=<percent>    Require a minimum percentage of explicit function-likes (0-100).

Arguments:
  /path/to/project                    Path to a PHP file or directory to check.
